  "rationale": "78 units of Cream Bun 200G at Outlet 05 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-16; doing nothing writes off ₹3955 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹1426. This play uses a bundle with SKU-CURD-500ML at ₹115 for 308 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Sweets occasionals, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 31 units, margin ₹305, discount cost ₹468, waste avoided ₹1581 (CI 2 to 91 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the Cream Bun with Curd 500ML at a bundle price of 115 INR, which satisfies the 8% bakery margin floor. It is preferred over markdowns by policy and targets all consented customers across the available segments to maximize clearance.",
